 (HERE/'reports/STATISTICAL_APPENDIX.md').write_text('# 统计补充\n\n单位是15个配对development split，先各split内平均三seed的指标，不先混合所有appearance概率；ensemble单系统指标直接减基线seed均值。阈值DD>.5，tiePD。AUROC为原代码macro两列AUROC；NLL为未裁剪proper unweighted log loss，Brier为两类平方和，ECE为10等宽topconfidence。\n\nSplit bootstrap固定seed20261112、10000次抽15split；Wilcoxon含effect size/dz/rank-biserial及wins/ties/losses。原阶段主族2/10/2/2不变；最终全局主族16=8候选×BA/AUC，次族56=8×其余7指标；logit辅助独立9。缺失XGB与RF非有限NLL检验按p1占位参与调整、自身p/q为NA，不缩小family。BH不修复重叠split依赖。global p/q不是新增事后保留门槛。\n\n患者cluster sensitivity按276PD/114DD分层、10000次多项抽样。同一人的所有split/seed出现共享一个权重；每个draw重新计算每model的九指标，seed内平均后15split等权，与原paired统计相同estimand，不改成pooled appearances。固定已训练模型，不含重新训练不确定性；有零类/非有限draw如实记录，<9500有效draw则NA。校验每个345预测包的单位权重weighted metric对原程序误差≤2e-12，cluster point estimate与原paired mean一致。\n\n'+table(cluster[cluster.metric.isin(['ba','auroc','pd_recall','dd_recall'])][['condition','metric','mean_delta','ci_low','ci_high','finite_draws','invalid_draws','status']])+'\n\n全部九指标详见subject_cluster_bootstrap.csv。seed_stability.csv同时区分mean within-split3seedSD、三个seed全局均值SD和between-splitSD。固定ensemble seedSD不可识别；between-splitSD是不同诊断。geometry无pair独立性检验。\n')
 (HERE/'reports/CORRECTNESS_AND_PROVENANCE.md').write_text('# 正确性与来源边界\n\n启动核验45旧checkpoint/seed/split/train-query-excluded/norm/标签映射/特征SHA与原预测，保护22585既有文件。mainline源码和原split/预处理/模型均未改。A1只用合法分模型缓存；A2一个434D表示，每个scaler及classifier train-only fit，禁止跨split混合；SVC内部Platt是训练内概率估计，不是encoder全链OOF。B45run原参数无梯度且statehash不变，zero-output初始化精确原logits；新模块梯度、mask/NaN、token数、checkpoint恢复、重复推理通过。C45run原seed初始化逐位匹配，合法不同PD身份positive、DDnegative，缺positive为0不复制患者；原始真实长度/左右腕/activity顺序保留，padding、梯度、独立恢复、确定性、allowlist负例通过。全新90深度run和180传统finalfit，旧checkpoint不覆盖。\n\n历史特征提取当时读过全队列缓存，这是永久来源限制；本轮先核验每模型ID角色再解码该train∪validation包，没有解码全390人sensor/feature NPZ。旧feature创建时逐文件hash未保存，不能伪称完整创建时不可变追踪；当前hash、旧提取源码freeze、P5来源保护、P6完整validation重现共同支持有条件复用。C只读当期allowlist原processed六轴与官方固定HarNet每人external，与其他fold监督encoder无关。metadata整CSV被用于身份/标签审计及粗来源描述，包含历史excluded元数据；这是应用层筛选，不是OS/物理隔离。保留过去outer文字接触、whole-manifest/NPZ与公开检索摘要暴露披露；本轮没有旧outer性能/信号loader，也不把既往outer重新称untouched。\n\n每个epoch验证BA选checkpoint，属于既定开发选择，不称完全未接触validation标签；无validation名单参与梯度/权重/参数搜索，无outer选模型。logs/逐人预测/IDs/feature/weights仅服务器私有目录；公开只有代码/协议/汇总。final_integrity及source_output_manifest给出可核验结果。无异常值删除、概率裁剪、失败试验删档。\n')
 (HERE/'reports/NEXT_STAGE_RESEARCH_PLAN.md').write_text('# 下一阶段候选计划（不执行）\n\n保持正式Frozen WSSL-STR single-model和原0.5规则；不因本轮B的BA/AUC提升破例接受DD下降。当前优先级是真正独立队列和表征重复测量可靠性，须先完成患者不重叠、双腕11活动可比性、原始单位/采样率/设备、PD/DD诊断、伦理访问和模型单checkpoint锁定检查。没有满足条件的数据时明确阻塞，不用同一PADS重复划分冒充独立验证。\n\n方法上本轮所测传统读出、B单层interaction、C单一PD-positive SupCon配置的固定研究闭合。不得按最好seed/阈值/新名字扩充失败配置。B留下的是“内容交互改变类间敏感性平衡”的描述假设，不是可自动保留模型；geometry不是临床机制。任何新的类别风险控制或损失设计都需要新的明确问题、独立验证/预登记预算和停止门槛，不能基于本轮validation错人名单训练。\n\n本报告仅规划，Phase9未启动。\n')
 directions=[dict(direction='Independent PD/DD cohort',hypothesis='frozen representation and decision generalize to new patients',evidence='repeated PADS gains fail joint gate; Phase7 has no eligible independent cohort',difference_from_failed_experiments='new patients/cohort; no adapter/gate/threshold/recipe search',expected_contribution='estimate transportability with clear clinical label and device limits',training_cost='0 new fits; budget one locked inference per eligible record after new authorization',retain='prespecified endpoint and sample-size plan before outcomes; report BA/AUC/F1/class recalls with cluster CI',stop='no nonoverlap proof, incompatible PD/DD labels/tasks, unresolved access/ethics, or failed preprocessing correctness'),dict(direction='Repeated-measure representation reliability',hypothesis='locked embeddings and probabilities are reproducible across repeat sessions',evidence='seed stability is not measurement reliability; current geometry is repeated-development descriptive',difference_from_failed_experiments='within-patient repeated sessions, no new supervised auxiliary loss',expected_contribution='separate acquisition/session variation from disease differences',training_cost='0 new fits; fixed inference only; requires genuine session repeats',retain='prespecified ICC/agreement/embedding reliability endpoints and cohort-specific thresholds before inspection',stop='no true repeats, incompatible sensors/tasks, inadequate precision or unresolved provenance')]
